@startuml
' UML Component 04 — Current integration seam index
' Evidence status: Implemented and architecture-guarded.
' Updated: 2026-07-29.

!pragma layout elk
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontColor #172554
}

component "Consumer Command / Query" as Consumer
component "Consumer-owned port\n→ outer adapter" as Port #FEF3C7
component "Stable provider contract\nfact · event · protocol" as Contract #DCFCE7
component "Composition factory\nconstruction only" as Factory #F3E8FF

Consumer ..> Port : required capability
Port ..> Contract : adapter maps provider seam
Factory ..> Consumer : constructs + injects

note bottom
Direct provider-internal imports and executable public facades
are not current accepted seams; guarded baselines are zero.
end note

@enduml
